{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1064202001:1":{"text":"Darn it... that dream again.","source_cn":"该死的……又是这个梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF1879952F12207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064202002:1":{"text":"The nightmare circles back like it always does. Ain knows it too well. All he can do is pray to wake before it goes any further.","source_cn":"周而复始的噩梦……埃因再熟悉不过。他祈祷着自己能马上清醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE341152642B969C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064202003:1":{"text":"Soon enough, Micah will appear, grabbing his shoulders, calling to him until the Hypofiends' wild laughter swallows everything.","source_cn":"要不了多久，迈克尔又会在梦中出现，摇晃他，呼唤他，直到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB28D45366C9F7D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064202004:0":{"text":"Hey! Wake up!","source_cn":"大哥哥……大哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42A7AF87F7928FFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064202005:0":{"text":"Why are you lying here?","source_cn":"你怎么躺在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5CE402E9D61A845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064202006:1":{"text":"Who's there?!","source_cn":"谁？！<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C467C04CB9C8CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064202007:1":{"text":"Ain jolts awake. There is a girl in the pale moonlight, looking down at him.","source_cn":"埃因猛地撑开眼睛。清冷的月光下，有个小女孩正站在一旁，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518B6716EB284608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064202008:1":{"text":"She hugs a strange-looking unicorn doll to her chest.","source_cn":"小女孩怀着还抱着一只造型奇特的……独角兽玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF161A4A01DF41B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064202009:0":{"text":"Sorry... Did I scare you?","source_cn":"对不起……我吓到你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407FEEA33F41A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064202010:1":{"text":"... No.","source_cn":"……没有。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB37902081C3C2CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064202011:1":{"text":"I can hear the sound of gunfire... Why are you here alone? It's dangerous.","source_cn":"能听到炮火声……小姑娘，你为什么一个人待在这里？这里很危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0B9482FEDDBFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064202012:1":{"text":"Mmm... I know.","source_cn":"嗯……我知道。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F3AD36DD10BB115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064202013:1":{"text":"There's a fight not far from here... Hypo—those horrible creatures could reach the village at any time.","source_cn":"远处在打仗，魔……唔，那些可怕的怪物，随时可能入侵村子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51B5F9629C07BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064202014:1":{"text":"But... you're here alone too.","source_cn":"可是，大哥哥，你不是也没走吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2B7C83C5A63ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064202015:1":{"text":"Anyone who could run has already fled. Why didn't you go with them?","source_cn":"能逃跑的人，都离开了。你不和他们一起吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBA730FE4063E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064202016:1":{"text":"Run? N-No... I can't.","source_cn":"逃跑？不，不对……我不能跑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75577CBFFA0FCC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064202017:1":{"text":"Why?","source_cn":"为什么？<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7453A98B439BD3DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064202018:1":{"text":"I have to join everyone and kill those Hypofiends that are destroying the world!","source_cn":"我得和大家一起，杀了那些祸害世间的魔物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8363F290825EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064202019:1":{"text":"Kill Hypofiends?\nBut isn't that what soldiers and mages are for?","source_cn":"杀魔物……？\\n这种事，不是应该交给士兵，和魔法师吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5C1EE117F35DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064202020:1":{"text":"Can't you tell? I am a soldier!","source_cn":"你看不出来吗？我就是士兵啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF661C10357B3F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064202021:1":{"text":"Mmm. You are dressed like one...","source_cn":"唔，你的确穿着士兵的衣服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD05101ABCC2E8906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064202022:1":{"text":"But this village is nowhere near the front. And you were clearly sleeping when I found you.","source_cn":"可是，这座村子离前线很远……你为什么会在这里睡觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DEE268D4703C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064202023:1":{"text":"Don't look at me like that. I'm confused, too...","source_cn":"别用那种眼神看我，我也不知道自己为什么会出现在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC345B389C60C49CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064202024:1":{"text":"Oh? Could you be a deserter?","source_cn":"噢吼？莫非说，你是逃兵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD95DEE8E05C89A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064202025:1":{"text":"Who's there?!","source_cn":"……谁？！谁在说话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8CD2764EEF0236E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064202026:1":{"text":"Wh-What? I didn't hear a thing...","source_cn":"有、有人说话吗？我没听到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70AAECE1582B2350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064202027:0":{"text":"You're so tense you're hearing things... Maybe it was just a bird up in the trees?","source_cn":"大哥哥，你太紧张了……是不是把树梢上的鸟鸣听错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805377548B33AE3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064202028:0":{"text":"There are barely any birds left here. Anyway, I—","source_cn":"这地方哪还有几只鸟？总之，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BDB52A7E09636CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064202029:1":{"text":"BANG!","source_cn":"——砰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67C58F9D43C40EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064202030:0":{"text":"Following a deafening blast, a blinding red flare rises at the horizon. The boom makes Ain flinch back and shiver before he can stop himself.","source_cn":"伴随着巨大的爆炸声，刺目的火红从天边飞起。如同惊雷的声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1140E2E847C22EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064202031:0":{"text":"Another suffocating night like this. Gunfire. Explosions. These are the final memories of the battlefield he still carries. He couldn't save Micah. His life, like his comrades, plunged into darkness, never to see the morning light again.","source_cn":"同样昏沉的夜晚和可怖的袭击，构成了他对于战场的最后记忆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE160F4DC9585322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064202032:0":{"text":"It's all right... Calm down...","source_cn":"大哥哥……没事的，别害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2D003E3C066BA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064202033:0":{"text":"I'm fine... <shk>I'm not a deserter!!</shk>","source_cn":"我、我没有害怕……<shk>我不是逃兵！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894FF45195E94EA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064202034:0":{"text":"I know... You've fought to the very end.","source_cn":"我知道……你不是逃兵，你战斗到了最后一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD436DB11FE34BE68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064202035:0":{"text":"Everyone knows that... including the goddess Dura.","source_cn":"大家都知道……艾雅女神，也知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C3BA298CE953C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064202036:0":{"text":"Ain looks at her blankly. For a brief moment, her silhouette perfectly overlaps the statue of Dura as if she were the goddess made flesh.","source_cn":"埃因恍惚地望着她，有那么一瞬间，她的身影竟与艾雅女神的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB06E336D5A11ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064202037:0":{"text":"But... but the war isn't over yet. The end hasn't come. I have to go back. They need me!","source_cn":"但是……但是战争还没有结束，最后一刻还没有来临……我得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B65F465E282917E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064202038:0":{"text":"No, wait. This place won't stay untouched for long, and it's too dangerous for you to be alone. I need to get you somewhere safe first.","source_cn":"……不，不行。不能把你独自留在这里。战火蔓延的速度很快...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8500A805ECF8E9D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064202039:1":{"text":"You mean it?","source_cn":"带我走？真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3765A89BF6BF306","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064202040:1":{"text":"I'm weak. I get tired easily. I won't be able to keep up with you... And I'll only slow you down if Hypofiends show up.","source_cn":"我的力气很小，体力很差，跟不上你的步子……万一遇到魔物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B0320DA57E7580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064202041:0":{"text":"I might get you killed... or worse.","source_cn":"说不定，你会被我害死……或者是，比死更惨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB8BBBE257333BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064202042:0":{"text":"Will you still take me with you?","source_cn":"即便这样，你也要带着我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596A9CE64AE8F8FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064202043:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064202044:0":{"text":"Stop talking nonsense. Stay close.","source_cn":"少说傻话，跟紧我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3A52B44DE8BD76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064202045:0":{"text":"I'll protect you even if we're facing an abyss.","source_cn":"哪怕坠入深渊，我也会保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD872864248CE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064202046:0":{"text":"I swore an oath, as one of the Expeditionary Force... to protect everyone.","source_cn":"身为远征军的一员……我发过誓，要保护所有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B7FBF084084A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064202047:0":{"text":"Mhm. I believe you.\nAin.","source_cn":"嗯，我相信你。\\n埃因哥哥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840815A9AD1C7C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064202048:0":{"text":"H-How do you know my name?","source_cn":"你……你怎么知道我的名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397CB1EFB7696F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064202049:0":{"text":"You told me yourself.","source_cn":"啊……是你自己说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D01518BF015576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064202050:0":{"text":"I did?","source_cn":"我？我说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EE2804E2ACF540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064202051:0":{"text":"O-Obviously. There's no one else here.","source_cn":"当、当然……这里没有其他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38EB50C2EA7547E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064202052:0":{"text":"How else would I know it?","source_cn":"如果不是你告诉我，我怎么可能知道呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF68F686329FB107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064202053:0":{"text":"Maybe I forgot...","source_cn":"呃，也许真是我忘了自己说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B0906C35BA8E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064202054:0":{"text":"Then what's your name?","source_cn":"对了，你叫什么？我还不知道你的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9AA9A2323561E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064202055:0":{"text":"I'm Aurora.","source_cn":"我叫……奥萝菈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B4D55C25A4019D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃因":{"text":"Ain","source":"埃因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小女孩的声音":{"text":"Girl's Voice","source":"小女孩的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:抱玩偶的女孩":{"text":"Girl with Doll","source":"抱玩偶的女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雄厚的声音":{"text":"Deep Voice","source":"雄厚的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巨大的声音":{"text":"Loud Voice","source":"巨大的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":56,"localized_text_count":55,"speaker_count":6}}